        "title": "Workbook: 好き(な)／きらい(な) - Lesson 5 | Genki Study Resources - 2nd Edition",
        "description": "Create sentences for the things you like and the things you dislike. Use 好き(な) for \"like\" and きらい(な) for \"don't like.\" Use 大～ for emphasis, to say you strongly like/dislike or more simply \"love/hate\" something.",
        "keywords": "Genki I Workbook, page 50, japanese, quizzes, exercises, 2nd Edition",
        "canonicalUrl": "https://sethclydesdale.github.io/genki-study-resources/lessons/lesson-5/workbook-6/",
